    "keep_one": "If every keep_i remains close to FULL, each slot likely carries most of the global modification.",
    "full_cap_vs_mean": "Compare FULL_capK against mean_xK at the same K. If they are close, real slot-specific information contributes little beyond recurrent execution depth; the gap FULL_capK-mean_xK estimates residual complementary slot information.",
